        Computing and AI now shape how we learn, work, and decide. In <strong>LT 2010</strong> we'll help you
        become a thoughtful, capable, and <strong>ethical</strong> participant in that world — starting from
        wherever you are. <strong>No prior experience is required, and everyone belongs here.</strong>
