          <p>First up: complete the <strong>Week&nbsp;1 discussion</strong> and the short <strong>AI / digital-tool survey</strong>. Both are due <strong>Jan&nbsp;17</strong>.</p>
          <span class="edit"># Update this panel each week — change the week, topic, and what's due.</span>
