        <h2>How to get started</h2>
        <p class="sub">Do these five things and you'll be set up for a smooth term. This page is your home base — come back to it every week.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><b>Read this page top to bottom.</b> <span>It's your map for the whole course — the schedule, what's due, and how we work together.</span></li>
        <li><b>Complete the Week 1 survey.</b> <span>The <a href="#schedule">AI / digital-tool survey</a> helps us meet you where you are. There are no wrong answers.</span></li>
        <li><b>Add the due dates to your calendar.</b> <span>Skim the <a href="#schedule">schedule</a> and drop the assignment dates in now, while you're thinking about it.</span></li>
