  <!-- SUPPORT / FAQ -->
  <section id="support">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">We've got you</p>
        <h2>Questions you might be asking</h2>
        <p class="sub">If something here isn't answered, reach out — asking early is always the right move.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details class="q" open>
          <summary>I've never coded or used a spreadsheet. Is that okay?</summary>
          <div class="a">Completely. There are <strong>no prerequisites</strong> — this course is designed for students of every background. We start from the basics and build up together, and you'll never be penalized for asking a "beginner" question.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="q">
          <summary>How much time will this take each week?</summary>
          <div class="a">Expect a steady, manageable weekly rhythm: one topic, one discussion, and periodic assignments. The final units run two weeks each to give you breathing room. <span class="ph">[Add your expected weekly hours here.]</span></div>
        </details>
        <details class="q">
          <summary>Can I use AI on my assignments?</summary>
          <div class="a">Sometimes yes, sometimes we'll practice without it — and we always ask you to be transparent about how you used it. The details live in <a href="#charter" style="color:var(--accent-ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Our AI Charter</a>.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="q">
          <summary>What if I fall behind?</summary>
          <div class="a">Reach out early — before a deadline rather than after. We'd much rather help you make a plan than have you disappear. <span class="ph">[Add your late-work / extension policy here.]</span></div>
        </details>
        <details class="q">
          <summary>How do I get help?</summary>
          <div class="a">Post in the weekly discussion, come to office hours, or email us. <span class="ph">[Add office hours, response-time expectations, and any support resources here.]</span></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
