          </svg>
        </div>

        <p class="legend"><b>★</b> Two-week unit — extra time is built in for your final assignment. Topics and readings are subject to change; always check this schedule for the latest.</p>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table class="sched">
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">Week</th><th scope="col">Topic</th><th scope="col">This week</th><th scope="col">Due</th></tr>
            </thead>
