        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 ASSIGNMENTS -->
  <section class="entry" id="assignments">
    <div class="wrap entry-grid">
      <div class="gutter"><span class="idx">03</span><span class="glabel">Assignments</span></div>
      <div class="entry-body">
        <h2>Three assignments, applied</h2>
        <p class="lead">Each turns an idea from the course into something you've actually made. Weekly discussions run throughout, and Week 1 opens with the AI / digital-tool survey.</p>
        <ol class="files">
          <li>
            <span class="fidx">01</span>
            <div class="fbody"><h3>Finding &amp; judging information</h3><p>Put information literacy into practice: locate sources, evaluate credibility, and defend what you choose to trust.</p></div>
            <span class="fdue">Due Feb 7</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fidx">02</span>
            <div class="fbody"><h3>Your professional presence</h3><p>Build and present a professional digital identity — the version of you the information age meets first.</p></div>
            <span class="fdue">Due Mar 7</span>
          </li>
          <li class="final">
            <span class="fidx">03</span>
            <div class="fbody"><h3>Working &amp; creating with data</h3><p>Bring the term together: work with data, tell its story, and apply computational thinking to a problem you care about.</p></div>
            <span class="fdue">Final · Apr 26</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 CONTACT -->
  <section class="entry" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap entry-grid">
      <div class="gutter"><span class="idx">04</span><span class="glabel">Contact</span></div>
